1
00:00:00,045 --> 00:00:01,515
(Leonard:)I came here to apologize.

2
00:00:01,513 --> 00:00:02,913
(Penny:)Okay. Leonard,
I really appreciate that,

3
00:00:02,915 --> 00:00:05,615
(Penny:)but I need a little time
to myself.

4
00:00:05,617 --> 00:00:07,117
Wha... Okay. I don't get it.

5
00:00:07,119 --> 00:00:08,549
(Leonard:)You said make an effort.

6
00:00:08,554 --> 00:00:10,484
(Leonard:)Here I am, making an effort.

7
00:00:10,489 --> 00:00:12,459
(Sheldon:)Hello, Amy. It's
nice to see you.

8
00:00:12,457 --> 00:00:16,227
(Amy:)Nice to see you, too.

9
00:00:16,228 --> 00:00:19,828
(Sheldon:)And that's how you make
effort look effortless.

10
00:00:19,831 --> 00:00:21,031
(Howard:)All right.
Can you please just go

11
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:22,263
(Penny:)and we'll talk
about this tomorrow?

12
00:00:22,267 --> 00:00:23,267
(Leonard:)I don't understand
what you want!

13
00:00:23,268 --> 00:00:24,968
I'm trying to figure it out!

14
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,100
(Sheldon:)You know what? If you'd like,

15
00:00:26,104 --> 00:00:28,944
(Sheldon:)I could whip up a quick
Relationship Agreement.

16
00:00:30,042 --> 00:00:31,072
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm at a spa,

17
00:00:31,076 --> 00:00:33,746
(Sheldon:)might as well do
something relaxing.

18
00:00:33,745 --> 00:00:35,875
(Amy:)Sheldon, why don't
we give them some privacy?

19
00:00:35,881 --> 00:00:38,181
(Sheldon:)Very well.

20
00:00:38,183 --> 00:00:39,613
(Sheldon:)Hey. Later, we'll check
out the minibar?

21
00:00:39,618 --> 00:00:42,848
(Sheldon:)I'll show you
how Godzilla gets drunk.

22
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:48,860
(Howard:)So what we did was map
out the entire room

23
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:51,900
(Howard:)to identify every squeak.

24
00:00:51,897 --> 00:00:54,227
(Howard:)Watch. It's easy,
once you get the hang of it.

25
00:00:56,468 --> 00:00:59,168
(Raj:)Step.

26
00:00:59,171 --> 00:01:02,141
(Raj:)Step.

